@PatriotFrontNews » Activists from Network 1 (NorTex) and Network 2 (CenTex) assembled at the San Jacinto Monument in recognition of Memorial Day. The colossal stone structure marks the battlefield where Texan forces defeated invading Mexican army, and secured the independence and later annexation of Texas and much more of the American west. The members marched to and around the monument, delivering a speech and leaving a wreath at the site.

