@PatriotFrontNews » Video footage from one of Patriot Front's many flyer teams at the national March For Life in Washington, D.C.

🦅 Submit your application today:
patriotfront.us/join

@PatriotFrontSightings » Patriot Front's demonstration at the March for Life has been featured in an article published by The Advocate, a blog dedicated to homosexual propaganda. The article bemoans Rousseau's 'anti-Semitic' remarks and notes patriot front's high level of organization. 

"The group moved in disciplined rows — a visual hallmark of Patriot Front’s efforts to project order and inevitability."

⭐️ Watch PF's 2025 March for Life Demonstration here.

@PatriotFrontSightings » Photos of Patriot Front have been featured in photo galleries published of the March for Life by USA Today, HJ News, Times Argus, and Texarkana Gazette.

🇺🇸 See more from PF's pro-family rally in Washington here.
⭐️ See PF's pages and interviews here.

@PatriotFrontNews » Patriot Front activists are on the ground in Washington, D.C., for the organization’s annual rally outside the national March For Life to show support and represent the interests of the American people.

Submit your application today:
patriotfront.us/join

