@PatriotFrontSightings » Patriot Front has been sighted at March for Life, in Washington D.C. The organization also demonstrated parallel to pro-life marches in 2024 and 2025.

🇺🇸 Hear more about PF's religious principles here.

⭐️ See our pages and interviews here.

@PatriotFrontSightings » Thomas Rousseau remotely gave a speech at the annual "Pen & Sword" winter seminar held by Der Dritte Weg [The Third Way] in Germany. The speech, joined by a translator, covered subjects ranging from the challenges of PF's foundational years, to the methods of demonstrations and media production, to a general outlook on the establishment of a healthy nationalist culture.

🇺🇸 PF maintains positive relations with the nationalists of Europe wherever possible. See a video report of activists visiting France here.

🏹 Read more about the conference here.

@PatriotFrontSightings » Thomas Rousseau will be live on The Daily Toll tomorrow at 7 p.m. Central.

🏹 Watch the show live on Rumble.
🏹 Watch the show live on Entropy.

@PatriotFrontNews » Thomas Rousseau was interviewed by political commentator James Edwards for the American Free Press newspaper.

