patriotfront.us/social

@PatriotFrontNews » Patriot Front activists demonstrated in Orem, Utah in response to the assassination of Charlie Kirk. Members placed banners around the city calling attention to the incident, and gave an address near Utah Valley University.

🇺🇸 Submit your application today:
patriotfront.us/join

@PatriotFrontSightings » Thomas Rousseau is live with a Q & A on Jake Shield's Fight Back Podcast.

Watch the show live on Rumble here.

Watch the show live on X (formerly Twitter) here.

@PatriotFrontSightings » Today at 7 p.m. Central, Jake Shields speaks with Thomas Rousseau on unity, building community, and the virtues of organizing.

📍 Watch the interview premier on YouTube here.

📍 Watch a previously released discussion featuring TR, Shields, and Aarvoll from the RTTL project here.

@PatriotFrontSightings » An “antifa” account is advertising targets designed to imitate Patriot Front members, as seen at numerous peaceful and lawful demonstrations. Alongside these calls for violence are fundraisers for degenerate monstrosities.

Additionally, the account sells merchandise that encourages others to engage in political violence and assassinate those it sees as its political enemies. While posts supporting terrorism would typically violate Instagram's terms of use, the platform often grants exception to far left extremists.

🛡️ See why PF uses shields, and its commitment to peaceful conduct here.

@PatriotFrontSightings » Patriot Front mentioned in the Jake Shields interview on Alex Jone's Info Wars. Alex Jones, who has previously fedjacketed the organization claims live on air that "Thomas Rousseau is welcome to come on [Info Wars]."

⭐️ See what we do, and why:
patriotfront.us/action

